OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FRain across western counties
OL,6,Fsoon spreads east, with some heavy
OL,7,Foutbreaks possible at times. Breezy,
OL,8,Fwith strong winds over high ground and
OL,9,Falong the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells on Sunday, showers across the
OL,13,FPeak District later. Cloudy periods
OL,14,Fand windy on Monday. Rain moving in
OL,15,Ffrom the northwest on Tuesday. Turning
OL,16,Fnoticeably milder from Monday onwards.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
